  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "主路径：在线点播",
      "items": [
        "前端 GetSongUrl → POST /__ipc { cmd: get_song_url, hash }",
        "HomeApi 调 kugou::Client.song_url()；tracker.kugou.com /v6/priv_url 回播放 URL",
        "HTML5 Audio 直连 CDN；命中缓存则改为 GET /__cache/{hash}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "信任边界",
      "items": [
        "HTTP 只绑 127.0.0.1:0，WebView 同源加载；CorsLayer::permissive 不出本机",
        "酷狗在进程外。协议签名 / AES / RSA 留在 kugou crate 私有，不进前端",
        "登录 token 存在 ~/.config/wmplayer/cookies.txt，启动时注入 Client；图上不连线以免穿越主路径"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "未画连线",
      "items": [
        "登录 QR / 短信、搜索、歌单、FM、设置、托盘 ksni 都走同一条 dispatch",
        "cookies.txt 是本机会话，不是酷狗云上的节点"
      ]
    }
  ]
